  "description": "Yellow Black USDC (USDC) is a BEP-20 stablecoin deployed on BNB Smart Chain, pegged 1:1 to the US Dollar. Inspired by the cosmic duality of black and yellow — the void of a black hole and the fire of a dying star — the token symbolizes the eternal cycle of creation and collapse in the universe. Black represents the infinite silence between stars; yellow represents the quantum energy released when a sun explodes and collapses into a black hole. That energy is the liquidity. That light is the peg. That void is the contract. Built for stability and safety, Yellow Black USDC integrates anti-dump protection, anti-whale limits, price protection, and whitelist mechanisms. The contract is verified, open-source, and fully transparent on BscScan. Every transaction is visible on-chain. Every rule is enforced by code. Welcome to the Black & Yellow Protocol — the cosmic economy on-chain.",

